<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Quang Trung</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1753–<a href="/years/1792">1792</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/18th-century">18th century</a> · Also known as Nguyen Hue, Nguyễn Huệ</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Quang Trung, born Nguyen Hue, was the ablest of the three Tay Son brothers who rose against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nguyen-lords">Nguyen lords</a> in 1771. He overthrew the Trinh lords in 1786, proclaimed himself emperor in 1788 and routed a Qing invasion at Dong Da in 1789. He began land and administrative reforms but died in 1792.</p></div>
